    "description": "The Retail Orders Returns Listing API enables users to retrieve comprehensive information about retail orders that have been returned. This endpoint provides access to detailed records of order returns, including original order details and reason for return. It is particularly beneficial for retailers and customer support teams aiming to analyze return trends and improve customer satisfaction. Typical consumers of this API include inventory managers, customer service representatives, and business analysts seeking insight into return activities.",
